{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_first_order_s1", "label": "First-order frozen-orbital screening S1", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S92-ITEM1-SP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Built from Slater F0/F^k/G^k integrals of the field's own converged orbitals with c = 137.035999 the only number, so the ratio is a field quantity with nothing fitted. Predicted S1 > S on 10/10 because frozen orbitals overestimate screening and relaxation gives some back."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_rho_plateau_088", "label": "The 0.88 plateau (rho = S/|P|)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S92-ITEM1-SP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A ratio near 0.88 shared across the five own rows is the residue that ruling Y declares not finished; the whole s92-s93 chain exists to turn it from a coincidence of magnitudes into one named field object."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_pure_field_rho0", "label": "Pure-field ratio rho0 = S1/|P1|", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S92-ITEM1-SP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Contains no computed D anywhere, so if rho0 reproduces the own>other inequality the plateau is a property of the field's own orbitals rather than of the chain instrument."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_residue_not_finished", "label": "Ruling Y: residue = not finished", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S92-ITEM1-SP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An unexplained residue keeps the item open rather than being absorbed; each failure branch names which successor item inherits it (if P4 fails the residue moves to relaxation and s92 item 2 must compute it)."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_canfail_lever_dead", "label": "Can-fail pair: lever-dead and control-validity", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S92-ITEM1-SP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both can-fails must themselves fail before any row is scored, and the F91.1 rule forbids telescoping identities - the control check is explicitly not an identity because it compares a fresh solve against a sealed number."}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_first_order_s1", "target": "recovered_prediction_s91_item1_swing_screening_term_s", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S92-ITEM1-SP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_rho_plateau_088", "target": "recovered_prediction_s91_item1_swing_proton_term_p", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S92-ITEM1-SP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_rho_plateau_088", "target": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_first_order_s1", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S92-ITEM1-SP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_pure_field_rho0", "target": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_rho_plateau_088", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S92-ITEM1-SP.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_residue_not_finished", "target": "recovered_prediction_s92_item1_sp_rho_plateau_088", "relation":